  "_help": "Every release. The page sorts them by releaseDate, newest first, and adds filter buttons (Albums / EPs / Singles) when there is more than one type. Copy the _example block into the releases list for each release. links: fill only the platforms that exist, empty ones are hidden; the key names come from data/platforms.json. Clicking the cover opens the platform named in primary (or the first link). cover is optional; a coloured placeholder is shown until you add one. tracks is optional (useful for albums). language: optional. When releases have more than one language, the Music section is split into one group per language (in the order of the languages list at the top of this file), with jump buttons.",
